{"56:77":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeed, it is a noble Qur’ān."}],"56:78":[{"type":"text","text":"In a Register well-protected;"},{"type":"footnote","id":"197493","label":"1"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"56:79":[{"type":"text","text":"None touch it except the purified "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[i.e., the angels]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"56:80":[{"type":"annotation","text":"[It is]"},{"type":"text","text":" a revelation from the Lord of the worlds."}],"56:81":[{"type":"text","text":"Then is it to this statement that you are indifferent"}],"56:82":[{"type":"text","text":"And make "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[the thanks for]"},{"type":"text","text":" your provision that you deny "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[the Provider]"},{"type":"text","text":"?"}],"56:83":[{"type":"text","text":"Then why, when it "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[i.e., the soul at death]"},{"type":"text","text":" reaches the throat"}],"56:84":[{"type":"text","text":"And you are at that time looking on -"}],"56:85":[{"type":"text","text":"And We "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[i.e., Our angels]"},{"type":"text","text":" are nearer to him than you, but you do not see -"}],"56:86":[{"type":"text","text":"Then why do you not, if you are not to be recompensed,"}],"56:87":[{"type":"text","text":"Bring it back,"},{"type":"footnote","id":"197494","label":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" if you should be truthful?"}],"56:88":[{"type":"text","text":"And if he "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[i.e., the deceased]"},{"type":"text","text":" was of those brought near "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[to Allāh]"},{"type":"text","text":","}],"56:89":[{"type":"text","text":"Then "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[for him is]"},{"type":"text","text":" rest and bounty and a garden of pleasure."}],"56:90":[{"type":"text","text":"And if he was of the companions of the right,"}],"56:91":[{"type":"text","text":"Then "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[the angels will say]"},{"type":"text","text":", \"Peace for you; "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[you are]"},{"type":"text","text":" from the companions of the right.\""}],"56:92":[{"type":"text","text":"But if he was of the deniers "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[who were]"},{"type":"text","text":" astray,"}],"56:93":[{"type":"text","text":"Then "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[for him is]"},{"type":"text","text":" accommodation of scalding water"}],"56:94":[{"type":"text","text":"And burning in Hellfire."}],"56:95":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeed, this is the true certainty,"}],"56:96":[{"type":"text","text":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great."}],"57:1":[{"type":"text","text":"Whatever is in the heavens and earth exalts Allāh,"},{"type":"footnote","id":"197495","label":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" and He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise."}],"57:2":[{"type":"text","text":"His is the dominion of the heavens and earth. He gives life and causes death, and He is over all things competent."}],"57:3":[{"type":"text","text":"He is the First"},{"type":"footnote","id":"197499","label":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" and the Last,"},{"type":"footnote","id":"197498","label":"2"},{"type":"text","text":" the Ascendant"},{"type":"footnote","id":"197497","label":"3"},{"type":"text","text":" and the Intimate,"},{"type":"footnote","id":"197496","label":"4"},{"type":"text","text":" and He is, of all things, Knowing."}]}